OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening is expected with clear spells,
OL,7,Fbut becoming breezy. Cloud will
OL,8,Fthicken through the night however,
OL,9,Fwith patchy light rain arriving into
OL,10,Fsouthwestern parts by the end of the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FMostly cloudy start, with
OL,14,Frain in the southwest slowly moving
OL,15,Facross all areas. Rain may be
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
